WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.979 --> 00:00:18.050
The 8th January 1835 is the only day in history
that the USA had no national debt.

00:00:18.050 --> 00:00:23.550
In the 19th and early 20th centuries, having
all your teeth removed and replaced with false

00:00:23.550 --> 00:00:27.929
ones was a popular 21st-birthday present.

00:00:27.929 --> 00:00:32.009
The UK's Dyslexia Research Centre is in Reading.

00:00:32.009 --> 00:00:38.780
There are more living organisms in a teaspoonful
of soil than there are people on Earth, and

00:00:38.780 --> 00:00:44.680
a billion times more in a tonne than there
are stars in the Milky Way.

00:00:44.680 --> 00:00:52.870
The 10,000 trillion ants in the world weigh
about the same as all the human beings.

00:00:52.870 --> 00:00:58.850
The US tax code is four times as long as the
complete works of Shakespeare.

00:00:58.850 --> 00:01:05.110
All the batteries on Earth store just ten
minutes of the world's electricity needs.

00:01:05.110 --> 00:01:09.520
Ancient Greek democracy lasted for only 185
years.

00:01:09.520 --> 00:01:16.090
The average person walks the equivalent of
three times around the world in a lifetime.

00:01:16.090 --> 00:01:24.940
The United States of America maintains a military
presence in 148 of the 192 United Nations

00:01:24.940 --> 00:01:26.220
countries.

00:01:26.220 --> 00:01:33.170
More than 50% of NASA employees are dyslexic,
but are hired for their superior problem-solving

00:01:33.170 --> 00:01:38.420
and spatial-awareness skills.

